<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">PHP</para>
  <para style="toc2">PHP</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHP</para>
  <para style="mt">PHP</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s">UTAKADA U BULUS KURWA PA HAYAHUDAWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Gya Bulus na Timoti agyama Yesu Kristi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">kurwa pa aco na yiwa na lagana Hwinsu ana yiwa na Pilipi, na aco na yiwa na byangana na hadikinoni:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Dala a burya̠ na duro u suwa una yiwa pa Hwinsu Buca a buci na buca bu yaba Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Si goji Hwinsu ka̱mu hona gya na mabutaryage na ga̱hi. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Tuhonba na soo cine, gya na ia̱gu ahunda̱ zwama ga̱hi <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />na yiwa na gaje Hwinsu zwama i gamu i sicwa nihin na gya pa ibwana i cikarigo ci laco tun hon jigo hal ka baniya <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Na daki Hwinsu una u rwage ibwana i burya̠ pa ga̱hi, ui hoga eyn hal kurwa hon Kristi Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />U gyamace gya hina na ma butaryaga ka̱mu na ga̱hi harbuni, nga̱ gya ne za na suwa; zwama ka̱mu nuhin i yiwa na hoge ina gya na yiwa na hoge ko i burya̠ na yiwa na pare suwa ukaba u ci; ncu zwama cikarigo ci laco cina gya nayaje na ciba. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Hwinsu ube u sa seda namui inga gya na yiwa na maka̠la̠ nuhin ka̱mu na maka̱la̱ ma Kristi Yesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Na yiwa na ahunda̠: maka̠la̠ amahin ma yan dajo dajo na idaku i Hwinsu na igano i cikarigo ci Hwinsu, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />uni ui bangana i pwan i tanga ina i zake gama zwama hon na Kristi aba ai maringe ai bangi na nagu ciriyo, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />nga̱ hasuwa ha̱hin hai sinji na saawo sa i burya̠ sina sa korya pa Yesu Kristi ina i zangacu na iyabo i Hwinsu.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Ahun nimui, na ginbo i yan na cidaka, ina i egyi na gya i jidane san cikarigo ci laco ci ese muhuga dinya. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Hal ini isan musoja mu bugwama na aco menwa mu daki an a na pare na ukaba u ci;incu zwama cikarigo ci Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />I gundano ina aba na gunda na ukaba u ci'incu u san alagano a̱hun cware na hunwo cu'a koce u suwa nagu ui iwasa i cubago cikarigo laco.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Kamahinda acagiya aco a eagu cikarigo ci Kristi zwama isibu na maka̠la̠ ma icwa, ama cagiya zwama i burya̠. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Aco ni nayiwa na zwamaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu zwama i burya̠ a ia̱gu zwama maka̠la̠, a daki an a na gunda na ukaba u ci'incu zwama gya na yisan cikarigo ci laco. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Aco a ea cikarigo ci Kristi zwama maka̠la̠ ma sicwa saba, sa kamahinda, a inga an ko ai jidana na pan wahala. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ama i jidanuwa ihya, ko na nupi u cibya,ko nabiya na kamahinda, a cibage cikarigo ci Kristi. Zwama haruni suwa nimui ui cinya. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />zwama na daki an zwama ahunda̱ nahin na ibanganu ina i A̱huru a burya̠ a Yesu Kristi, ina egyi na gya i maringe isan a na curi. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Na ka̱ri na soo nimui an gya ta kulagiya icwa nimui zwama u muya, ama ia̱ cikarigo na koce u soo pa ina ka̱mu gya na ia̱gu Kristi a hin izangacu tohonba na ikanga nimui, ko na yiwa ko na kwaji. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ina yiwa suwa numui, si na yiwa zwama Kristi, hinda sa na kwaji riba a pamui. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Sa ui sana na kwajuwo, na ea ibwana i anpani. Ka̱mu na haruni bai gya na tangana? Na dakuwo! <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Kamahinda hasuwa a hamui ha ma habusage cirya: Na ka̱ri curi doone une hinda gya madale na Kristi, haruni una zaka dinyiya; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />ama zwama ga̱hi u gyamace ta kwada. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Nga̱ uba sa na za shaka na soo numui, na daki na yana na ga̱hi kacumo zwama i ma jidane koce na soo cine pa itano i suwa. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />zwa sa na gope i kulaka a pahin i hin yina ga̱hi i ia̱ cikibi na Kristi Yesu zwama ina aba ia̱gu pa gya kurwa a pahin.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Ina ia̱ ka̱mu, i ia̱ dala ana asa aika ugo una u gyamace cikarigo ci laco ci Kristi. Ko na kore ko hinda na korya, hoge na i yiwa na jabaga na burya̠ , hasoo a hahin haikan pa iyajo na cikarigo ci laco <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />sa tare na ihogo i iwasa aco na ai yajuwa na ga̱hi. Ai uni u sa kamahinda an ai hone, ama ga̱hi i za i kwaji-uni usa kamahinda pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ama i burya̠ ina aba ai egyi zwama Kristi sa na iyaje na Yesu kawi, ama i so wahala zwama Bware, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />i yiwa na hoge ina ga̱hi i hya na hoge, hinda i hoge hal ka baniya na yiwa hoge.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">I lagano i Yesu pa nagu izangacu ui icwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />I yiwa na hya i jidano i suwa zwama Kristi, ko i yiwa na hya i dulacumu i suwa zwama maka̠la̠ ma Yesu, ko iza i gamu i sicwa zwama An hunrun a Hwinsu, ko hinda iza maka̠la̠ yama na hasuwa an hanhin, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />sa izi ini ka̱mu na yiwa na i ona isa wa̱wo nimui ima sinji pa cikarigo a cihin ci sa cikan, na maka̠la̠ maikan, na nupi uikan. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ita ia̱ihya na maka̠la̠ ma icwa kwa di na izibiwo i icwa ama ita ciba i zake cagiya aco. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Tiganba buta madama zwama icwa i buba, ama zwama cagiya aco.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Suwa una ga̱hi i zan u san una u nyaga na una u Kristi Yesu:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Buna bu za kama a Hwinsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">ama bwe zanguwo icwa i buba busa Hwinsu,<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />ama bu maisi icwa i buba bui sa ihya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">bu zangi icwa i bugyama Bu maringe nga̠ buco.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Bace na haruni na inyagano na buco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">Bware bu maisi icwa i buba bwe sa ihya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">hal bu yaje bu kwaji</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PHP 2:8">hal ma u'o u masacu ma o'on!<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Hinda na haruni, Hwinsu u zangaci Bware zata una u zake tibai zangaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">kwa na pan bware iziya ina i zake tinba izaya moso,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />hinda na pano iziya i Yesu cilabe hanwungurumi kanmu hai kuzat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">na zaro ko na cinge na imya i cinge,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />na tanba anre an hin Yesu Kristi isa Buca̱ bu yaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">pa izangacu i Hwinsu na Buca.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cingero inga muginga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Zwama haruni, si'osa a simui sina gya na ka̠ri, inga ganhin i rigyano i yaje na cikarigo caba gya tare na ganhin, na gibo i zake hon gya na za tare na ganhin ma i zake-re je gaba na ibwana zwama icago nihin i sinji hinda i gamai iwasa na cidagaro ci ikanga. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Zwama Hwinsu u be u yiwa na ibwana na suwa nuhin ube hinda ui san i ea i burya̠ ina uba ginbo<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Eaga je tibai sa tare na ha wonzorwa ko masisa, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />zwama i san aco nagu magwata̠ na saawo sa nagu ciri, sina si yiwa na doone u aco ciri, i cibe bangaro nuhin nga̱ muginga mu doone <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />inga ga̱hi i zwama ga cicuma ci laco-inga gya na ia̱ga cikibi hon uringeewo u Kristi inga uba ui sana na ia̱gu cihano kanmui. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Hinda i yajo nihin na Hwinsu i nyaga na i baciga i umuga na piso mahya ma Yesu na hoge wonwo tare na gahin. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />gahin ma i ea wanwo tare na Gya.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti na Abaporiditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Na tane suwa na Buca bu yaba Yesu na gya cumane na Timoti kurwa a pahin na za i sana, zwama gya ma jidane ihoge koce u hawungurumi sa na hoge labari nuhin <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Zwama na za buciyahya inga Timoti buna bu ma dami kamahinda na ga̠hi. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Zwama tiganba ka̠mu bu ka̱ri ina hasuwa hab ginbo, sa ina Yesu Kristi aba ka̱ri. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ama i daki an Timoti a cibo icwa ya ba na bu jube, zwama bware bu ea ibwana i cikarigo ci laco tare na gya buca bu bware. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Na ginbo i cuma bware kurwa a pahin si na hoge ina i ia̠ga na gya. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Hinda sa Hwinsu u yaje gya ma na korya na icwa nimui muhon amone.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Ama na hyan u gyamace gya cumane na buhun a buci Abaporiditus ana a ia̠gi ibwana na ihona tare na gya buna hinda busa nga̠ acuma na bangana. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Zwama bware bu cimgagi bui hyan hal soo u bware labucuwa zwama ihogo ina i ga̠hi i hoge na bware bu rumagi. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Kamahinda bware bu rumagi, hal ma inga bwe kwaji. Ama Hwinsu u hoge yama i bware, na gya ma ta hoga suwa siri. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Zwama haruni gya na jidane i cimugaga cumane na bware, zwama jidane i hoge laco si ihyan bware, hinda ihacigago i soo nimui u ali. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ca je bware na maka̠la̠ Hwinsu tare na wa̱wo dinyiya, i pan bware cilabe, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />zwama bware bu gane cimu bu kwaji zwama ibwana i Kristi, zwama bu ia̠gi taimaki una ga̠hi i ma yage na ia̠gya.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Ibwana i burya̠</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Na ihogu ka̠mu, ahun namui,ea je wanwo na malagana na Hwinsu!I za na gaguma gya gope na ia̠gya cikarigo cina ci nyaga na cina ci gya ia̠gi da, hinda ui zakana na laco.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Masiki je na aco na eagu iwo, a sa nga̠ siwa, aco na a gundagu ikanga an a ia̠ kaciya. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ai gaci ci za kaciya ka kamahinda,sa abiya, ga̠ci buna ci pa Hwinsu cilabe pa a̠huru a Hwinsu hinda na wanwo na Kristi Yesu, ci panuwa koce na ibwana i ikanga- <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />ko inga gya na pan koce na iri uni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Sa a za buna bwe pan koce na ibwana ikanga, gya na zake bo na ika̱ri: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />An egyi kaciya na mohon utataco na maco na sa buco izraila, nasa bwa azwaga a Bayami, mahyan a mamu masa Buparisawa; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />pa ilagano yina ana gya na yiwa naba, na pangano aco na yiwa na lagano Yesu wahala; pa ilagano i cibago i Musa nabiya aza na hyana na magwata̠.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ama na jigu ina na sanase izana baniya i maringe nagu zwama Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Baniya tibai na mesi gya isa nagu, zwama moso u iziya i Kristi Yesu buca bu yab a bumui, zwama abe gya na kwama i ka̠mu. Na zangi ini ka̠mu isa daba, zwama gya hin Kristi <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />hinda gya magami na Kristi, na za dala burya̠ i icwa nimui ina aba a hyangu pa ilagano cikarigo ci Musa, baniya na za dala burya̠ ina aba ai hyan pa Kristi dala a burya̠ an a sirya pa Kristi, dala a burya̠ ana a sirya zwama itano i suwa i buco pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Ina gya na ginbo daki Kristi hinda gya hoge koce na yiwa pa wansengowa u Kristi pa aco a kwajo tare na wahala u Bware buba so, hinda gya san inga Bware pa u'o. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Zwama ko neya gya wuci masenge pa aco a kwajo. <verse eid="PHP 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Na hinwo na rigyano na hyinwo tibaiya, ko hinda na rigyano na sano ina aba ginbo, kwa di na yiwa na eaga kokari i nasara zwama Kristi Yesu an maisi bwa ba. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Ahun namui, na hinwo an na rigyano na wucu ihuga ina aba ginbo. Ama i bikan gya na eagu: si mainga na i na ya ali kacuta na yiwa na ea kokari ia̠ ina yiwa gaba. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Si yinsa na koce na eagu i zwama gya hin ina yiwa gaba ube usa dalili kurwa u uhunpacu una Hwinsu uba na egyi zwama Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Kanmu nuci gaci buna ci monsa na i daku i Hwinsu ci zangi iri uni tunane, ama si na suwa nuhin sa za buna cikarigo cina ca sa cikan, to Hwinsu ui ci dakacuma. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Ina aba ginbo ka̠mu ihuga ina gaci ci wuci, ci ali pa ihuga ina gaci yinsa. <verse eid="PHP 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Hinan je na lagana iri cihano a cimu, hinda i laga cihano ci ahun ana ea iri cihano a cici. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Na sano gya na eagya cikarigo cini, baniya ni yiwa na jidana na eagya na cidaro,dala ba asa aco yiwa na wonje u'o u Kristi. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Iri aco ni ihogu yaba isa yaba ula, mukab musa hwinsu waba, nagu u mueyan mua ba mube musa cikibi caba, suwa waba u yiwa pa i dwoniya. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Ga ci cisa aco cugwama ci Hwinsu. Gaci cimugagu kurwa Buca bu yaba Kristi Yesu ana a yiwa na kurwa na zaro. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Yesu abe aza koce na i kole tibai na koce waba, hinda bu sake mukanga a muci mu nyaga na ikanga i Bware.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Yinsa na kuce na Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Zwama haruni, ga̠hi ahun nimui ana gya na ka̠ri tunuhun, hal ma naza maka̠la̠ ma ihyanagu ganhi na yiwa na wa̱wo na daje ana gya na hyan zwama ibwana i burya̠ nimui, niyiwa nabu une i yisa na kuce na Kristi, ga̱hi ana yiwa na maka̠la̠. <verse eid="PHP 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Na yiwa na une hacube ha Yudiya na Sintiki, a i dala a makanmla zwama asa a Hwinsu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Goo hinda a'usa a ibwana nimui a kamahinda, na yiwa na bu une bu taimaki si'a sina, zwama a suwo sungolo na ibwana i cikarigo ci laco ci Hwinsu. Harbuni hinda Kilemen na a'usa a ibwana nimu, ana iziye yaba a rubuci unwa na utakada u a̱huru ana aza ihogu. <verse eid="PHP 4:3" /><verse number="4a" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4a" />Eag wow na Kristi tunnahun. Na yiwa nabu zwamaga: Ea wawo! <verse eid="PHP 4:4a" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />I yan na suwa u maka̠la̠ na aco ka̱mu, ea mabuturagya uringuwo u Kristi u yabtan. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ita dama na ko na ihya, ama kwa di a zwama Hwinsu tibe na une na ahunda̱, kanmu na igoju. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Na haruni Hwinsu uba ui pan dala a burya̠ una u zaki na cidaka ci buwama, ui anpe suwa nuhin na iwombu nuhin na suwa Kristi.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Na ihogu ahun nimui, ea iwumbanu i suwa na ina isa kamahinda, na ina i jube a pan unwa cilabe, na ina isa dai dai, na ina iza ciri, na ina iyiwa na kula maka̠la̠, na ina isa i burya̠ wato na ina ka̠mu iyiwa na i zake ka̠mu na burya̠, ko ina aco na pan cilabe, na ina ka̠mu ea iwombo i suwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ea ina ga̠hi koyi na ina hinda ga̠hi ce na ina ga̠hi huge, i hyan pa gyamui. Hwinsu u dala a burya̠ ui yan na ga̱hi.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus bu goji alagano na Filibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Na i wawo dinyiya zwama baniya ini cibe ana iyiwa na ia̠ kula na gya, ama ya hinwo dama i ni cibe. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Na hinwo haruni zwama gya bu hin ihya, ama na koyi inga gya na dala na iri timamba. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Na daki inga gya na dal ko na nagu ko na ihinwo. na pa i dala na iri timamba, ko na imirwo ko na sidagi, ko na nagu ko na ihinwo. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Na pa ea tibai na koce u Kristi una u buba ni pa. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ka̠mu na haruni, i iyi na burya̠ inga ga̠hi i mabuturyagya na gyamui na sungolo. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />gahin aco a Filibiya i daki, hunna gya na rwagu ni zwamagu cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci laco, inga gya na curi cingfe ci Makidoniya ko na aco na yiuwa na laga Yesu una u gami sicwa na gyamui na ipangano ko na icagu kwa ga̱hi kawai. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Zwama ko hunna gya nayiwa na Tasalonika, i ni cuma icwana ina gya na kanla sa so uinka. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ita tana suwa ana nayiwa na ginbo ihya pa ganhi,aye kwa di nayiwa na gimbo ina aba jidana na itanagan na riba nuhin. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />An cupe kanmu, icupu ina i wuci misali; igimbago nimu i sinji, zwama na ce daje na ga̠hi i cuma Abaporiditus. Uni usa daji ui kamshi, hinda usa sadaka una Hwinsu ui ce hinda hugi wawo uba. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Hwinsu nimu ui bu cupe ka̱mu igimbagu nunhi na izangacu i uba na unu u burya̠ waba dinya pa Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Izangacu iyiwa pa Kristi na Buca abuci hal ihogu. Harbuni.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibungagu ihogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />ga̠in alagana Hwinsu, i bungagu ka̠mu aco nagu cirya na soo Kristi Yesu. Ahun ana a yiwa na gya ayiwa nabu bungaga. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Aco naguciri ka̠mu a yiwa nabu bungaga, masaman ana a yiwa na iginga i Kaisar. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />I burya̠ Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi i yan na a̱huru nuhin. Harbuni.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>